{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06118","headline":"辋川别业 · 王维","name":"辋川别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不到东山向一年，归来才及种春田。\n雨中草色绿堪染，水上桃花红欲然。\n优娄比丘经论学，伛偻丈人乡里贤。\n披衣倒屣且相见，相欢语笑衡门前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}